       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TSTRXISADJ.
       AUTHOR.              JEFF BUNGO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        08/04/97.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      * THIS PROGRAM IS FOR NON CSIS EXTERNAL SYSTEMS TO CALL IN ORDER
      * TO MAKE STOREROOM ISSUES AND STOREROOM ADJUSTMENTS TO INVENTORY.
      *
      * THE FOLLOWING PARAMETERS MUST BE PASSED TO THIS PROGRAM FROM
      * THE EXTERNAL SYSTEM:
      *    CORP-CDE - CSIS CORPORATE CODE
      *    QTY      - QUANTITY OF ISSUE OR QUANTITY AFTER ADJUSTMENT
      *    UM       - UNIT OF MEASURE
      *    NON-SIG  - NON-SIG FOR ISSUES (CHARGE CUSTOMER)
      *    MSG      - STATUS MESSAGE BACK TO CALLING PROGRAM
      *               IF SPACES THEN SUCCESSFUL CALL
      *
      * IF THE NON-SIG PARAMETER IS NOT SPACES THEN THE CALL IS
      * CONSIDERED AN ISSUE.  IF THE NON-SIG PARAMETER IS SPACES
      * THEN THE CALL IS CONSIDERED AN ADJUSTMENT.
      *
      *C  07/19/2001    CA YODER
      *C     CHANGED QUANTITY FIELD IN LINKAGE SECTION TO COMP-3.
      *C
      *C  08/15/2001    CA YODER
      *C     CHANGED BIN ADJUSTMENT LOGIC TO SUBTRACT ADJUSTMENT
      *C     QTY INSTEAD OF ADDING IT.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MSTORERM
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DDAILYTC
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MPLTINFO
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MSTORERM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.
       FD  DDAILYTC
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDAILYTC-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1600  OF MCFLCS1601.
       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE              PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".
       77  SUB                          PIC 9(1).
       77  DUMMY-REQFILNO               PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.
       77  BASE                         PIC X(10).
       77  COMPANY-CODE                 PIC X(3).

       01  SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE           PIC S9(8).
       01  SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE            PIC S9(8).

       01  RET-CODE                     PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  WORK-QTY                     PIC 9(8)  VALUE ZEROS.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X(1)  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X(1)  VALUE "0".

       COPY LANGUAGE   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLT0      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTP01    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DDAILYTC   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TC333      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TC433      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TC332      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TDATECHK   IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  CORP-CDE              PIC X(7).
       01  QTY                   PIC S9(8)   COMP-3.
       01  UM                    PIC X(2).
       01  NON-SIG               PIC X(10).
       01  MSG                   PIC X(80).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CORP-CDE
                                QTY
                                UM
                                NON-SIG
                                MSG.

       1-HOUSEKEEP.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

           OPEN I-O MSTORERM
                    DDAILYTC.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO.

      *------ GET COMPANY CODE
           MOVE "P 01" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO COMPANY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES TO COMPANY-CODE.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE MSTORERM
                 DDAILYTC
                 MPLTINFO.
           GOBACK.

       6-MAIN.
      *-----CHECK FOR EXISTENCE OF PASSED CORPORATE CODE
           MOVE CORP-CDE TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC.
           READ MSTORERM INTO BUF-MSTORERM
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "CORPORATE CODE DOES NOT EXIST" TO MSG
              GO TO 6-MAIN-X.

      *------EDIT UNIT OF MEASURE AGAINST CSIS PRIMARY UM
           IF UM NOT = STR-UM
              MOVE "UNIT OF MEASURE DOES NOT MATCH CSIS PRIMARY UM"
                 TO MSG
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.

      *-----DETERMINE IF AN ISSUE OR ADJUSTMENT
      *----- BASED ON THE NON-SIG PARAMETER
           IF NON-SIG NOT = SPACES
              PERFORM 61-ISSUE THRU 61-EXIT
           ELSE
              PERFORM 62-ADJUST THRU 62-EXIT.
       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.


       61-ISSUE.
           IF QTY > (STR-ONHAND - STR-RESERVED)
              MOVE "CSIS DOES NOT HAVE SUFFICIENT ONHAND FOR WITHDRAWAL"
                 TO MSG
              GO TO 61-EXIT.

           MOVE STR-ONHAND TO SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE.
           MOVE STR-RESERVED TO SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE.
           COMPUTE STR-ONHAND ROUNDED = STR-ONHAND - QTY.

      *-----REMOVE FROM BINS STARTING WITH FIRST BIN
           MOVE QTY TO WORK-QTY.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
             UNTIL SUB = 6 OR WORK-QTY = 0
                 IF STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB) < WORK-QTY
                     COMPUTE WORK-QTY = WORK-QTY - STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB)
                     MOVE 0 TO STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB)
                 ELSE
                     COMPUTE STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB) =
                             STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB) - WORK-QTY
                             MOVE 0 TO WORK-QTY
                 END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

           MOVE 1                        TO  DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT             TO  STR-ACT-DATE.
           IF STR-ACT-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO STR-ACT-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO STR-ACT-DATE-CC.
           MOVE STR-ACT-DATE-CN TO STR-LAST-IDATE-CN.
           MOVE NON-SIG TO STR-LAST-EMPL.
           MOVE STR-DFLT-DEPT TO STR-LAST-CHARGE.

           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC FROM BUF-MSTORERM
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "ERROR UPDATING ONHAND FOR CORPORATE CODE" TO MSG
              GO TO 61-EXIT.

      *----- CALL PROGRAM TO UPDATE THE REQFILE IF NEEDED FOR AUTO REQS
           CALL "TREQFILU" USING RET-CODE, BASE, DUMMY-REQFILNO,
             CORP-CODE, SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE, SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE,
             STR-ONHAND, STR-RESERVED, STR-REORDER, STR-EXPEDITE.

      *------WRITE TRANSACTION
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  DDAILYTC-DATA.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT             TO  DDAILYTC-DATE.
           MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO  DDAILYTC-TIME.
           MOVE COMPANY-CODE             TO  DDAILYTC-PLT.
           IF STR-AVG-COST > 99999.9999
               MOVE "433"                TO  DDAILYTC-TC
               MOVE CORP-CODE            TO  TC433-CORPCODE
               MOVE STR-LAST-EMPL        TO  TC433-EMP
               MOVE QTY                  TO  TC433-QTY
               MOVE STR-AVG-COST         TO  TC433-AVG-COST
               MOVE STR-UM               TO  TC433-UM
               MOVE NON-SIG              TO  TC433-WO
               MOVE STR-EXPENSE-CLASS    TO  TC433-EXP-CLASS
               MOVE STR-DFLT-DEPT        TO  TC433-DEPARTMENT
                                             TC433-REQ-DEPT
               MOVE STR-CLASS            TO  TC433-CLASS
           ELSE
               MOVE "333"                TO  DDAILYTC-TC
               MOVE CORP-CODE            TO  TC333-CORPCODE
               MOVE STR-LAST-EMPL        TO  TC333-EMP
               MOVE QTY                  TO  TC333-QTY
               MOVE STR-AVG-COST         TO  TC333-AVG-COST
               MOVE STR-UM               TO  TC333-UM
               MOVE STR-DFLT-DEPT        TO  TC333-DEPARTMENT
                                             TC333-REQ-DEPT
               MOVE NON-SIG              TO  TC333-WO
               MOVE STR-EXPENSE-CLASS    TO  TC333-EXP-CLASS
               MOVE STR-CLASS            TO  TC333-CLASS
           END-IF.
           WRITE DDAILYTC-REC FROM BUF-DDAILYTC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE SPACES TO MSG.
       61-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       62-ADJUST.
           MOVE 1                        TO  DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT             TO  STR-ACT-DATE.
           IF STR-ACT-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO STR-ACT-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO STR-ACT-DATE-CC.
           MOVE STR-ACT-DATE-CN TO STR-INV-DATE-CN.

           MOVE STR-RESERVED TO SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE.
           MOVE STR-ONHAND TO SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE.
           MOVE QTY TO STR-ONHAND.

           SUBTRACT QTY FROM SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE GIVING TC332-ADJ-QTY.

      *----- UPDATE BIN LOCATION ONHAND
      *-----  FOR INCREASES ADD TO PRIMARY BIN LOCATION
      *-----  FOR DECREASES REMOVE FROM BINS STARTING WITH PRIMARY
           MOVE TC332-ADJ-QTY TO WORK-QTY
           IF TC332-ADJ-QTY > 0
      ******   ADD TC332-ADJ-QTY TO STR-LOC-ONHAND(1)
               SUBTRACT TC332-ADJ-QTY FROM STR-LOC-ONHAND(1)
           ELSE
               PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                 UNTIL SUB = 6 OR WORK-QTY = 0
                 IF STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB) < WORK-QTY
                     SUBTRACT STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB) FROM WORK-QTY
                     MOVE 0 TO STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB)
                 ELSE
                     SUBTRACT WORK-QTY FROM STR-LOC-ONHAND(SUB)
                     MOVE 0 TO WORK-QTY
                 END-IF
               END-PERFORM
           END-IF.

           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC FROM BUF-MSTORERM
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "ERROR UPDATING ONHAND FOR CORPORATE CODE" TO MSG
              GO TO 62-EXIT.

      *----- CALL PROGRAM TO UPDATE THE REQFILE IF NEEDED FOR AUTO REQS
           IF TC332-ADJ-QTY NOT = 0
             CALL "TREQFILU" USING RET-CODE, BASE, DUMMY-REQFILNO,
               CORP-CODE, SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE, SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE,
               STR-ONHAND, STR-RESERVED, STR-REORDER, STR-EXPEDITE.

      *------WRITE TRANSACTION
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT             TO  DDAILYTC-DATE.
           MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO DDAILYTC-TIME.
           MOVE "332"                    TO  DDAILYTC-TC.
           MOVE COMPANY-CODE             TO  DDAILYTC-PLT.
           MOVE CORP-CODE                TO  TC332-CORP-CODE.
           MOVE STR-DFLT-DEPT            TO  TC332-DEPT-CHG.
      *------- 2 FIELDS EXIST FOR AVERAGE COST - IF COST IS GREATER THAN
      *------- 9,999,999.99 THEN THE SMALLER FIELD WILL BE TRUNCATED.
           MOVE STR-AVG-COST             TO  TC332-AVG-COST-SMALL.
           MOVE STR-AVG-COST             TO  TC332-AVG-COST-BIG.
           MOVE STR-UM                   TO  TC332-UM.
           MOVE STR-ONHAND               TO  TC332-NEW-ONHAND.
           MOVE STR-EXPENSE-CLASS        TO  TC332-DFLT-EXP-CLASS.
           MOVE STR-CLASS                TO  TC332-CLASS.

           WRITE DDAILYTC-REC FROM BUF-DDAILYTC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE SPACES TO MSG.
       62-EXIT.
           EXIT.
